{"question_id": "V2-dev-RPT-en-T2-001", "approach": "B1", "approach_base": "B1", "flags": {}, "setting": "en-en", "q_lang": "en", "d_lang": "en", "corpus": "D", "corpus_set": "D_en", "answer_text": "In 2024, Zalando evolved Zalando Plus from a paid membership to a free-to-join model with a points-based system rewarding engagement such as purchases and newsletter subscriptions, with points unlocking four benefit levels; tested in Spain and expanded to France and Austria, with further rollout planned for 2025 [1][2]. At year-end, the report mentions increased accruals for the reimbursement of Zalando Plus subscription fees to customers at the beginning of 2025, included in other current non-financial liabilities [3].", "abstained": false, "retrieved_units": [{"text": "[stripped: 523 chars]", "doc_id": "D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en", "section_id": "D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::o032", "unit_ids": ["D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::p90_b10"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 0, "span": [180825, 181348], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 867 chars]", "doc_id": "D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en", "section_id": "D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::o035", "unit_ids": ["D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::p99_b8"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 1, "span": [208793, 209660], "meta": {}}, {"text": "[stripped: 637 chars]", "doc_id": "D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en", "section_id": "D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::o095", "unit_ids": ["D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::p350_b10"], "kind": "unit", "score": null, "rank": 2, "span": [887683, 888320], "meta": {}}], "evidence_units": ["D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::p90_b10", "D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::p99_b8", "D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::p350_b10"], "evidence_items": [{"doc_id": "D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en", "section_id": "D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::o032", "kind": "unit", "chars": 523, "unit_ids": ["D.zalando_annual-report_2024.en::p90_b10"], "cut": false}, {"doc_id": "D.zalando_annual-report_20